an while five rate it Likely Republican, and Polymarket prices Stauber's chances near 88 percent. Stauber holds a clear financial advantage, raising roughly $2.0 million to Swanson's $650,000, and enters the final weeks with more than $1.2 million on hand.\n\nSwanson has run a visible campaign, touring the district and debating Stauber in Duluth, and a debate exchange in which Stauber denied making a comment he verifiably did make drew some attention. Still, no public polling exists, and the district's lean, incumbency, and money gap favor the incumbent. The forecast expects Stauber to win by high single digits, with uncertainty elevated because polling is thin.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.0911, "margin": -8.65}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.1026, "margin": -9.5}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.1108, "margin": -9.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.1084, "margin": -10.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.1049, "margin": -8.5}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.0871, "margin": -9.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.0901, "margin": -9.5}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.107, "margin": -9.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.0757, "margin": -10.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.0829, "margin": -9.5}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.082, "margin": -9.5}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.1056, "margin": -9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.1215, "margin": -8.0}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.0741, "margin": -9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.0844, "margin": -9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.0764, "margin": -9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.0943, "margin": -9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.0865, "margin": -9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.083, "margin": -9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.0838, "margin": -9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.0792, "margin": -10.0}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.0882, "margin": -9.5}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.0721, "margin": -9.5}, {"d